   "source": [
    "# Binning :\n",
    "Binning is the process of converting numrical data into categorical (groups) or bins.\n",
    "Instead of using exact numbers like -- 500,800,1000,1200,1500...\n",
    "\n",
    "we group them into bins:\n",
    "1. small house.\n",
    "2. medium house.\n",
    "3. large house.\n",
    "\n",
    "This is called discretization.\n"
   ]
  }
 ],
